id=xiaomi_usb_sec_bypass
name=Xiaomi USB Security Bypass
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=CHERWIN
description=Enable "USB debugging (Security settings)" / "USB install" / fastboot on rooted MIUI without Mi account & SIM. Forces persist.security.adbinstall, persist.security.adbinput, persist.fastboot.enable plus SecurityCenter's own USB-install switches at every boot, so the developer-options toggles stay on and scrcpy/Total Control/adb install work.
